on mouseUp
  [  0] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [  2] thebuiltin 15 ........................... <the clickOn>
  [  4] pushint8 102 ............................ <102>
  [  7] gt ...................................... <the clickOn > 102>
  [  8] jmpifz [ 54] ............................ if the clickOn > 102 then
  [ 11] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [ 13] thebuiltin 15 ........................... <the clickOn>
  [ 15] getglobal 16 ............................ <objectxx>
  [ 17] pushint8 13 ............................. <13>
  [ 20] set 6 ................................... set the locH of sprite the clickOn to objectxx
  [ 22] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [ 24] thebuiltin 15 ........................... <the clickOn>
  [ 26] getglobal 17 ............................ <objectyy>
  [ 28] pushint8 14 ............................. <14>
  [ 31] set 6 ................................... set the locV of sprite the clickOn to objectyy
  [ 33] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [ 35] extcall 18 .............................. updateStage()
  [ 37] pushint8 100 ............................ <100>
  [ 40] pushcons 0 .............................. <"piphead1">
  [ 42] pushcons 8 .............................. <"master">
  [ 44] pushint8 10 ............................. <10>
  [ 47] get 9 ................................... <the number of member "piphead1" of castLib "master">
  [ 49] pushint8 35 ............................. <35>
  [ 52] set 6 ................................... set the memberNum of sprite 100 to the number of member "piphead1" of castLib "master"
  [ 54] ret
end

on mouseDown
  [  0] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [  2] thebuiltin 15 ........................... <the clickOn>
  [  4] pushint8 13 ............................. <13>
  [  7] get 6 ................................... <the locH of sprite the clickOn>
  [  9] setglobal 16 ............................ objectxx = the locH of sprite the clickOn
  [ 11] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [ 13] thebuiltin 15 ........................... <the clickOn>
  [ 15] pushint8 14 ............................. <14>
  [ 18] get 6 ................................... <the locV of sprite the clickOn>
  [ 20] setglobal 17 ............................ objectyy = the locV of sprite the clickOn
  [ 22] ret
end
